{"id":"memorial_105101","cat":"memorial","group":{"id":"memorial105100","label":"Call Logs · Looking for the Giant.txt"},"label":"51001.txt","stage":null,"prev":null,"next":"memorial_105102","speakers":{},"icons":{},"lines":[{"id":"memorial_105101_1","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_51_01_description","text":"I found something strange."},{"id":"memorial_105101_2","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_51_01_description","text":"Huge footprints."},{"id":"memorial_105101_3","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_51_01_description","text":"And... they look human."},{"id":"memorial_105101_4","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_51_01_description","text":"If this were old-world art, there wouldn't be so many of them, scattered everywhere."},{"id":"memorial_105101_5","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_51_01_description","text":"What the hell? Could humans really have feet this big?"},{"id":"memorial_105101_6","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_51_01_description","text":"On closer inspection, they really are human."},{"id":"memorial_105101_7","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_51_01_description","text":"A giant?"},{"id":"memorial_105101_8","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_51_01_description","text":"Did giants appear on the surface when humanity entered the Ark?"},{"id":"memorial_105101_9","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_51_01_description","text":"I'll have to investigate further."}]}